@local/dsh-btw-sidechat README · BTW Side Chat：**Ask a side question in [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) without interrupting the main task.** `/btw` forks the current conversation with its full context, answers in a read-only side chat, and opens the answer in a Codex-style right-sidebar window.

[](https://github.com/Big-Smarty/dsh-btw-sidechat/actions/workflows/test.yml)
[](LICENSE)

@local/dsh-btw-sidechat README · Development：- the child title `BTW · Reply with exactly: BTW PROBE OK`;
- the answer `BTW PROBE OK`;
- the `btw:side-chat` section in the child's assembled prompt;
- `read`, `glob`, `grep`, `skill`, `read_image`, `web_search`, and `web_fetch` visible;
- `bash`, `write`, `edit`, and `run_code` absent (a preset-scoped `subagent` schema remained visible but is guard-denied);
- the command result address the Client parses.
